      <title>State files intent to appeal vehicle emissions testing decision</title>
      <link>https://www.nhpr.org/nh-news/2026-02-10/nh-appeal-vehicle-inspections-emissions-testing-decision</link>
      <description>A federal judge issued a preliminary injunction late last month ordering New Hampshire to take steps to continue vehicle testing beyond the sunset date for annual car inspections in order to comply with the Clean Air Act. The state, in turn, extended the deadline for expired inspections until April.</description>
